 the relationship\nmetadata table in the next slice. 46 new tests, including real HTTP\ntests of routing, validation, the success envelope and the error format.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-24T14:05:10-05:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/621943948aef0030313612467cfd02d051f105e7","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-24T14:05:10-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-24T14:05:10-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":["docs/network-workspace-api.md","src/network-workspace/network-workspace-slice1.service.spec.ts","src/network-workspace/network-workspace.controller.spec.ts"],"removed":[],"modified":["src/network-workspace/dto/network-workspace.dto.ts","src/network-workspace/network-workspace.config.ts","src/network-workspace/network-workspace.controller.ts","src/network-workspace/network-workspace.service.spec.ts","src/network-workspace/network-workspace.service.ts"]},{"id":"92c5798173f6cd2927e92a608d81962b1401551d","tree_id":"0ff5b5fb45df5a7cfe7fcce7ac395fbaba315c7c","distinct":true,"message":"feat(network-workspace): slice 2 notes, follow-ups and opportunities per relationship\n\nAdds the owner's private records for one relationship under\n/network-workspace/relationships/:id: activity (notes and logged\ninteractions), follow-ups (existing Task rows, relatedType 'relationship')\nand opportunities. Every route first proves the relationship is the\ncaller's (404 otherwise), validates with class-validator DTOs, and returns\nthe standard envelope and error format. None of it touches strength or\nlast-contact; the engine stays the only writer.\n\nMigration 20261124200000_network_activities_and_opportunities is additive\n(5 enums, 2 tables) and is NOT applied anywhere.\n\nAlso: the detail view's \"overdue\" now means the due day has passed (same\nrule as the Today counts), and three slice 1 files are prettier-formatted.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-24T15:31:57-05:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/92c5798173f6cd2927e92a608d81962b1401551d","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-24T15:31:57-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-24T15:31:57-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":["prisma/migrations/20261124200000_network_activities_and_opportunities/migration.sql","src/network-workspace/dto/network-records.dto.ts","src/network-workspace/network-records.config.ts","src/network-workspace/network-records.controller.spec.ts","src/network-workspace/network-records.controller.ts","src/network-workspace/network-records.service.spec.ts","src/network-workspace/network-records.service.ts"],"removed":[],"modified":["docs/network-workspace-api.md","prisma/schema.prisma","src/network-workspace/network-workspace-slice1.service.spec.ts","src/network-workspace/network-workspace.controller.spec.ts","src/network-workspace/network-workspace.module.ts","src/network-workspace/network-workspace.service.ts"]},{"id":"5539caf48371d93675701e8447d15e48e55a0c94","tree_id":"c0de2fefe85a0834b01ad2554eeebffc6a203490","distinct":true,"message":"feat(network-workspace): slice 3 discover and introductions (opt-in paths)\n\nAdds GET /network-workspace/discover and /discover/summary, and\nintroductions (create, list, respond, cancel). People are listed only if\nclaimed and searchable (same exposure as directory search). A path\n\"you -> connector -> person\" is built only through connectors who turned on\nthe new UserDetails.shareConnectionsForIntros (default off, set via PATCH\n/network/settings) and only from real-work relationships, never a\nconnector's manual contacts or muted links (invariants 20 and 22). An\nintroduction is a request the connector accepts or declines; nothing is\nconnected automatically. Requests are capped at 10 a day and queue an\nintroduction_requested outbox event (a no-op until a notify rule exists).\n\nMigration 20261125100000_network_introductions_and_intro_sharing is\nadditive (1 enum, 1 table, 1 column default false) and is NOT applied.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-25T08:26:27-05:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/5539caf48371d93675701e8447d15e48e55a0c94","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-25T08:26:27-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-25T08:26:27-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":["prisma/migrations/20261125100000_network_introductions_and_intro_sharing/migration.sql","src/network-workspace/dto/network-discover.dto.ts","src/network-workspace/network-discover.config.ts","src/network-workspace/network-discover.controller.spec.ts","src/network-workspace/network-discover.controller.ts","src/network-workspace/network-discover.service.spec.ts","src/network-workspace/network-discover.service.ts"],"removed":[],"modified":["docs/network-workspace-api.md","prisma/schema.prisma","src/network-workspace/network-workspace.module.ts","src/network-workspace/network-workspace.service.ts","src/network/dto/network.dto.ts","src/network/network-directory.service.ts"]},{"id":"f0ad95a426b4231ae53f92a86bf614af4c117e37","tree_id":"55459ed1450ae9a3dd57751acc63a87b32b2f78d","distinct":true,"message":"feat(network-workspace): slice 4 saved views, automation toggles and templates\n\nAdds saved-view CRUD (max 20 per user, unique name, only known filter keys\nstored), per-user on/off for the three relationship follow-up rules that\nexist in the Activity module (reply_to_unanswered, no_response_chase,\nreconnect_dormant_contact), and a code-config template library with a\nrender step that fills [Name] and [Role] for one of the caller's\nrelationships. Nothing is sent from templates.\n\nAutomation is enforced at one point: TaskService.createAuto skips creating\nthe task (and its notification) when the owner has an explicit\nenabled=false row; no row means unchanged behaviour.\n\nMigration 20261125200000_network_saved_views_and_rule_preferences is\nadditive (2 tables) and is NOT applied.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-25T08:43:20-05:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/f0ad95a426b4231ae53f92a86bf614af4c117e37","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-25T08:43:20-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-25T08:43:20-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":["prisma/migrations/20261125200000_network_saved_views_and_rule_preferences/migration.sql","src/network-workspace/dto/network-settings.dto.ts","src/network-workspace/network-settings.config.ts","src/network-workspace/network-settings.controller.spec.ts","src/network-workspace/network-settings.controller.ts","src/network-workspace/network-settings.service.spec.ts","src/network-workspace/network-settings.service.ts"],"removed":[],"modified":["docs/network-workspace-api.md","prisma/schema.prisma","src/network-workspace/network-workspace.module.ts","src/tasks/task.service.spec.ts","src/tasks/task.service.ts"]}],"head_commit":{"id":"f0ad95a426b4231ae53f92a86bf614af4c117e37","tree_id":"55459ed1450ae9a3dd57751acc63a87b32b2f78d","distinct":true,"message":"feat(network-workspace): slice 4 saved views, automation toggles and templates\n\nAdds saved-view CRUD (max 20 per user, unique name, only known filter keys\nstored), per-user on/off for the three relationship follow-up 